{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":22.010000228881836,"text":"A horse at full gallop, and on it a child with no saddle and no stirrups. His face is tight, his hair is blown back, his body is pressed flat along the animal's back. He came out of the same wreck as the big bronze, but in dozens of pieces, and it took years to put him back together. He was made around 14 B.C.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.47999998927116394},{"word":"horse","start":0.47999998927116394,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"at","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.0800000429153442},{"word":"full","start":1.0800000429153442,"end":1.399999976158142},{"word":"gallop","start":1.399999976158142,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"and","start":2.200000047683716,"end":2.319999933242798},{"word":"on","start":2.319999933242798,"end":2.5799999237060547},{"word":"it","start":2.5799999237060547,"end":2.7799999713897705},{"word":"a","start":2.7799999713897705,"end":3.0999999046325684},{"word":"child","start":3.0999999046325684,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"with","start":3.440000057220459,"end":3.7200000286102295},{"word":"no","start":3.7200000286102295,"end":4.039999961853027},{"word":"saddle","start":4.039999961853027,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"and","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"no","start":4.760000228881836,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"stirrups","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.519999980926514},{"word":"His","start":6.099999904632568,"end":6.260000228881836},{"word":"face","start":6.260000228881836,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"is","start":6.639999866485596,"end":7.239999771118164},{"word":"tight","start":7.239999771118164,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"his","start":7.639999866485596,"end":7.840000152587891},{"word":"hair","start":7.840000152587891,"end":8.119999885559082},{"word":"is","start":8.119999885559082,"end":8.539999961853027},{"word":"blown","start":8.539999961853027,"end":8.539999961853027},{"word":"back","start":8.